    "title": "Talco's annual Independence Day fireworks gathers thousands - NewsBreak",
    "text": "tribnow.com\nwebsite\nTalco\nTalco’s annual Independence Day fireworks gathers thousands\n1 days ago\nOn Friday, July 4, Talco lit up the sky as they do every year with a giant fireworks show to wow thousands of people. The event offered watermelon, drinks, vendors, and food while sitting in the heat and waiting for the sun to set. Even Texas representatives like Congressman Nathaniel Moran and State Representative of District 5 Cole Hefner came to watch the show. They also took the time to recognize Steve Bragg of Mount Pleasant, a Vietnam veteran who earned a Bronze star and Purple Heart when he served in the U.S. Army’s 1st Infantry Division.",
